</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Forever on Thy burdened heart</l><l>A weight of sorrow hung,</l><l>Yet no ungentle, murm’ring word</l><l>Escaped Thy silent tongue.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy foes did hate, despise, revile,</l><l>Thy friends unfaithful prove;</l><l>Unwearied in forgiveness still,</l><l>Thy heart could only love!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
